 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "They drew near the village where they were going",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he acted as though he would go farther",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But they urged him strongly",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stay with us, for it is evening",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stay with us, Lord, for it is evening",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the day is now far spent",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He took the bread and blessed it",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He broke it and gave it to them",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their eyes were opened and they knew him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he vanished from their sight",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stay with us, Lord, for it is evening",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the day is now far spent",
   "heard": 7,
